Modal(null);\n       |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^ Avoid calling setState() directly within an effect\n   999 |   }, [closeZoneSignal]);\n  1000 |   const signiW = 82, signiH = 82;\n  1001 |   const lowerW = 58, lowerH = 58;",["2767"],["2768","2769"],["2770","2771"],["2772","2773"],["2774","2775"],["2776","2777"],"React Hook useMemo has a missing dependency: 'initial'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["2778"],["2779"],"react-hooks/rules-of-hooks","React Hook \"useTimeCostCandidates\" cannot be called inside a callback. React Hooks must be called in a React function component or a custom React Hook function.","React Hook \"useTimeCostSelectionValid\" cannot be called inside a callback. React Hooks must be called in a React function component or a custom React Hook function.","@typescript-eslint/no-unused-expressions","Expected an assignment or function call and instead saw an expression.","unusedExpression","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'setBattleLogs'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["2780"],"React Hook useCallback has a missing dependency: 'setBattleLogs'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["2781"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'onBack', 'persist', 'setCpuDeckData', 'setIsCpuBattle', and 'setMyDeckData'. Either include them or remove the dependency array. If 'onBack' changes too often, find the parent component that defines it and wrap that definition in useCallback.",["2782"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'bs', 'persist', and 'user.id'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["2783"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'setLoading'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["2784"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'bs'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["2785"],"React Hook useEffect has a complex expression in the dependency array. Extract it to a separate variable so it can be 